WEBVTT

00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:30.676
if rocks are self-conscious
of their weight

00:02:30.956 --> 00:02:34.836
if mountains are insecure
of their strength

00:02:35.356 --> 00:02:39.636
I wonder if waves get discouraged

00:02:39.636 --> 00:02:42.356
crawling up the sand

00:02:42.356 --> 00:02:44.716
only to be pulled back again

00:02:44.716 --> 00:02:46.636
to where they began

00:02:46.836 --> 00:02:49.756
if land feels stepped upon

00:02:50.276 --> 00:02:53.396
if sand feels insignificant

00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:56.876
if trees need to question their lovers

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.916
to know where they stand

00:02:59.276 --> 00:03:02.636
if branches waver at the crossroads